{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Motorcycle",
    "steam_appid": 2222530,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/0c113ad211000a6f15c4efc1d9e36354.avif?t=1733857134\" /></div><br>A game where you are chased by a motorcycle. Based on a true story (only the park like map)<br>In this game, you need to collect five photos before you can escape the current map. Simple.<br>But be careful! One wrong step and you can end up drowing in the water with no help nearby, or get stuck in traps. And if you don't get unstuck quickly, she will find you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.poster.avif?t=1733857134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.webm?t=1733857134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.mp4?t=1733857134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/984522e443309c4fee480dfe9fd30b65.avif?t=1733857134\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Mode</li><li>Challenge Mode (speedrun mode)</li><li>Integrated autosplitter vars for all my speedrunners out there (more about that on the game website)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/0c113ad211000a6f15c4efc1d9e36354.avif?t=1733857134\" /></div><br>A game where you are chased by a motorcycle. Based on a true story (only the park like map)<br>In this game, you need to collect five photos before you can escape the current map. Simple.<br>But be careful! One wrong step and you can end up drowing in the water with no help nearby, or get stuck in traps. And if you don't get unstuck quickly, she will find you!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.poster.avif?t=1733857134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.webm?t=1733857134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/cf4731f9a4fc53b4846750e8abd5c8d5.mp4?t=1733857134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2222530/extras/984522e443309c4fee480dfe9fd30b65.avif?t=1733857134\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Story Mode</li><li>Challenge Mode (speedrun mode)</li><li>Integrated autosplitter vars for all my speedrunners out there (more about that on the game website)</li></ul>",
